{"data":[{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"0_1746249609.754312","card_id":"Q_1901747560105861976","target":{"id":1901747560105862000,"title":"杭州「胖都来」开业被质疑碰瓷「胖东来」，名字相似到底算不算侵权？品牌之间「撞名」有多敏感？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1901747560105861976","type":"question","created":1746191951,"answer_count":155,"follower_count":241,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[215,477,5647,16788,98079],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":"【杭州“胖都来”五一开业 胖东来：已取证投诉，并邮寄律师函】5月1日，浙江杭州一家名为“胖都来”的线下购物商场开业，多位明星发视频祝贺。该商场名称引发争议，不少网友质疑这是在碰瓷“胖东来”。该公司解释称，“胖”寓意丰盈、富足、美好，“都（dū）”取自集团董事长的姓氏，名字只是符号，品质才是关键。 对此，“胖东来”回应称：感谢大家对胖东来的关注和反馈，关于“胖都来”我们已经取证并向市场监督管理局提交投诉书，也通过EMS的方式给“胖都来”公司成功邮寄了律师函。我们会持续跟进此事，有阶段性的结果也会通过我们的官方账号进行公示。浙江胖都来卖场开业，胖东来：已向对方邮寄律师函，并投诉至市监部门_腾讯新闻"},"attached_info":"CkoIt8mD2r7ym5xBEAMaCTExNDc3ODc5NCDPjNPABjAAOPEBQAByEzE5MDE3NDc1NjAxMDU4NjE5NzZ4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"527 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pica.zhimg.com/80/v2-f7e969517ad464b1f966b67f4f41e390_1440w.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"1_1746249609.755355","card_id":"Q_1900843010197022088","target":{"id":1900843010197022200,"title":"如何看待《三国杀》「红桃 7 事件」暴露出的官方控牌情况？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1900843010197022088","type":"question","created":1745976289,"answer_count":114,"follower_count":213,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[253,2448,41706],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkoIt8mD2r7ym5xBEAMaCTExNDc0NzU1OCDh98XABjAAONUBQAFyEzE5MDA4NDMwMTAxOTcwMjIwODh4AKoBCWJpbGxib2FyZNIBAA==","detail_text":"516 万热度","trend":0,"debut":false,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-7243